  "kv5.4:11.1": "aniyatassa niyāmagamanāya atthi ñāṇanti. ",
  "kv5.4:11.2": "āmantā. ",
  "kv5.4:11.3": "gotrabhuno puggalassa sotāpattimagge ñāṇaṃ atthīti. ",
