  "kv5.4:12.4": "nanu bhagavā jānāti ",
  "kv5.4:12.5": "ayaṃ puggalo sammattaniyāmaṃ okkamissati bhabbo ayaṃ puggalo dhammaṃ abhisametunti. ",
